      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a \"small step\" thing. it's just... what's the point? even if i take a step, the cycle just starts again. i'm just waiting for the next crash. it feels less like a struggle and more like a life sentence of misery. i don't see how it ever gets better, honestly.",
