      "content": "stillness doesn't change anything though. it's just a pause before the next disaster. i feel like i'm just prolonging the inevitable pain. sometimes i think the only way to actually find peace is to just stop everything. to just not have to fight anymore. is that even a rational way to think? like, is it ever okay to just want it all to end?",
